              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Sage 2% Chlorhexidine Gluconate* Cloths</span></span></h1>\n<h2>Clinically proven CHG cloths address bacteria on the skin</h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Bacteria on the skin puts your patients at risk for surgical site infections (SSIs).&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 09 2024 15:41:26 GMT+0000",
